    "text": "JCROWN DIGITALS — React + Vite + Tailwind + Supabase personal brand site. Run with `npm run dev`. All 9 components (Navbar, Hero, About, Offers, DownloadCTA, Books, Newsletter, Contact, Footer) must be created; currently missing from src/components/",
