  {
    "id": "c6b7a0ac3170",
    "text": "Supabase is optional — src/lib/supabase.js exports `isSupabaseConfigured` and `supabase` (null if not set). Site degrades gracefully; books/forms just won't work without real VITE_SUPABASE_URL and VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY in .env",
    "tags": [
      "supabase",
      "configuration",
      "degradation"
    ],
