  },
  {
    "id": "2f0c92081829",
    "text": "Tailwind config: colors ink/charcoal/gold/ivory/muted, fonts Playfair Display + Inter, custom utility classes (container-x, eyebrow, btn-gold, gold-divider). Reveal.jsx wraps IntersectionObserver for 600ms scroll animations. All copy lives in src/lib/content.js",
